Root cause:
The bug was caused by the lack of support for a maximum MTU of 16KB in the RX buffer size calculation within the `stmmac_set_bfsize` function. The original implementation only allowed for buffer sizes up to 8KB, which would lead to issues when handling larger packets that exceed this limit.

